                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W1118600                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  LÄSER INFIL W01172 SAMT NOTERINGSFIL                  *        
*                SKAPAR LISTA MED ARTIKLAR SOM SKALL PUBLICERAS        *        
*                INOM NÄSTA REDOVISNINGSPERIOD                                  
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  MONICA                                                *        
*                                                                      *        
*  ÄNDRING    :                                                        *        
*                                                                      *        
*     DATUM       NAMN                     AVDELNING                   *        
*     ......      ..................       ......                      *        
*     ......      ..................       ......                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W11186D1                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W011100   'LB-'                                                                
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W11186D2                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W01162                                                                         
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W11186D3  PRINTER FB (121 121)                                             
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE VFIL01  FB (46 27968) VIRTUAL                                              
%W01162 'SEL-'                                                                  
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
W009VADD          W   8   A   VALUE 'W009VADD'                                  
WS-IDARTNR        W   8   N   MASK 'ZZZZZZZ9'                                   
WS-IDFKNGRP       W   4   N   MASK 'ZZZ9'                                       
WS-IDBERED        W   2   N   MASK 'Z9'                                         
WS-TIAAVV         W   3   P                                                     
WS-TIAAVV-START   W   3   P                                                     
WS-TIAAVV-SLUT    W   3   P                                                     
WS-ANTAL-VECKOR   W   2   P                                                     
WS-KDERS-OLD      W   3   N   MASK 'Z99'                                        
WS-KDERS-NEW      W   3   N   MASK 'Z99'                                        
WS-TIFINLV        W   4   N                                                     
WS-TIFINLV1       W   5   N                                                     
NOTERING          W   40  A                                                     
NOTERING-7        W   40  A                                                     
W-BLANK           W   59  A                                                     
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
%WDATKORT 'DATKORT-'                                                            
%WWPRODSL 'LB-' WORK ''                                                         
                                                                                
PROGRAM-NAMN      W   6   A   VALUE 'W01186'                                    
DATUMKORT-ID      W   6   A   VALUE 'WDATUM'                                    
                                                                                
INNEV-AAVV        W                4  N                                         
INNEV-AA          INNEV-AAVV       2  N                                         
INNEV-VV          INNEV-AAVV  +2   2  N                                         
                                                                                
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
%WDATAREA                                                                       
                                                                                
WDATKOV           W   8   A   VALUE 'WDATKONV'                                  
                                                                                
%WY2000W3                                                                       
                                                                                
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
* STEG 1. SELEKTERA NOTERING 3/7 = BEREDNING                                    
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT W11186D2                                                              
  IF NOT-KDNOTTYP = 3                                                           
    PUT VFIL01 FROM W11186D2                                                    
  END-IF                                                                        
  IF NOT-KDNOTTYP = 7                                                           
    PUT VFIL01 FROM W11186D2                                                    
  END-IF                                                                        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
* STEG 2. SKAPA LISTA                                                           
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W11186D1 KEY LB-IDARTNR VFIL01 KEY SEL-NOT-IDARTNR) +                
  START(A-INIT)                                                                 
                                                                                
  WS-IDARTNR = LB-IDARTNR                                                       
  WS-IDFKNGRP = LB-IDFKNGRP                                                     
  WS-IDBERED  = LB-IDBERED                                                      
  WS-TIFINLV1 = LB-TIFINLV                                                      
  IF MATCHED                                                                    
      PERFORM S25-CHECK-LB-KDPRODSL                                             
      IF LB-KDPRODSL = KDPRODSL-PARTS-CHEM KDPRODSL-ACC                         
        IF DUPLICATE VFIL01                                                     
           IF FIRST-DUP VFIL01                                                  
             WS-TIFINLV = LB-TIFINLV / 10                                       
             TMP1-YYWW  = WS-TIFINLV                                            
             TMP2-YYWW  = INNEV-AAVV                                            
             TMP3-YYWW  = WS-TIAAVV-SLUT                                        
             PERFORM WY2000Q3                                                   
             IF TMP1-YYWW  > TMP2-YYWW  AND +                                   
                TMP1-YYWW  LE TMP3-YYWW                                         
                                                                                
                 IF LB-KDERS = 0                                                
                    IF SEL-NOT-KDNOTTYP = 3                                     
                       NOTERING = SEL-NOT-TEARTNOT                              
                    END-IF                                                      
                    IF SEL-NOT-KDNOTTYP = 7                                     
                       NOTERING-7 = SEL-NOT-TEARTNOT                            
                    END-IF                                                      
                 END-IF                                                         
             END-IF                                                             
           ELSE                                                                 
             IF LAST-DUP VFIL01                                                 
                WS-TIFINLV = LB-TIFINLV / 10                                    
                TMP1-YYWW  = WS-TIFINLV                                         
                TMP2-YYWW  = INNEV-AAVV                                         
                TMP3-YYWW  = WS-TIAAVV-SLUT                                     
                PERFORM WY2000Q3                                                
                IF TMP1-YYWW  > TMP2-YYWW  AND +                                
                   TMP1-YYWW  LE TMP3-YYWW                                      
                   IF LB-KDERS = 0                                              
                      IF SEL-NOT-KDNOTTYP = 3                                   
                         NOTERING = SEL-NOT-TEARTNOT                            
                      END-IF                                                    
                      IF SEL-NOT-KDNOTTYP = 7                                   
                         NOTERING-7 = SEL-NOT-TEARTNOT                          
                      END-IF                                                    
                      PRINT RAPPORT01                                           
                    END-IF                                                      
                 END-IF                                                         
              END-IF                                                            
           END-IF                                                               
        ELSE                                                                    
          WS-TIFINLV = LB-TIFINLV / 10                                          
          TMP1-YYWW  = WS-TIFINLV                                               
          TMP2-YYWW  = INNEV-AAVV                                               
          TMP3-YYWW  = WS-TIAAVV-SLUT                                           
          PERFORM WY2000Q3                                                      
          IF TMP1-YYWW  > TMP2-YYWW  AND +                                      
             TMP1-YYWW  LE TMP3-YYWW                                            
                                                                                
              IF LB-KDERS = 0                                                   
                 MOVE SPACE TO NOTERING                                         
                 MOVE SPACE TO NOTERING-7                                       
                 IF SEL-NOT-KDNOTTYP = 3                                        
                    NOTERING = SEL-NOT-TEARTNOT                                 
                 END-IF                                                         
                 IF SEL-NOT-KDNOTTYP = 7                                        
                    NOTERING-7 = SEL-NOT-TEARTNOT                               
                 END-IF                                                         
                 PRINT RAPPORT01                                                
              END-IF                                                            
          END-IF                                                                
      END-IF                                                                    
    END-IF                                                                      
  ELSE                                                                          
    IF W11186D1                                                                 
      PERFORM S25-CHECK-LB-KDPRODSL                                             
      IF LB-KDPRODSL = KDPRODSL-PARTS-CHEM KDPRODSL-ACC                         
          WS-TIFINLV = LB-TIFINLV / 10                                          
          TMP1-YYWW  = WS-TIFINLV                                               
          TMP2-YYWW  = INNEV-AAVV                                               
          TMP3-YYWW  = WS-TIAAVV-SLUT                                           
          PERFORM WY2000Q3                                                      
          IF TMP1-YYWW  > TMP2-YYWW  AND +                                      
             TMP1-YYWW  LE TMP3-YYWW                                            
                                                                                
              IF LB-KDERS = 0                                                   
                  MOVE SPACE TO NOTERING                                        
                  MOVE SPACE TO NOTERING-7                                      
                  PRINT RAPPORT01                                               
              END-IF                                                            
          END-IF                                                                
      END-IF                                                                    
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
A-INIT. PROC                                                                    
  CALL DATKORT  USING (PROGRAM-NAMN +                                           
                       DATUMKORT-ID +                                           
                       DATKORT-DATUMKORT)                                       
  INNEV-AA      = DATKORT-D-AAR                                                 
  INNEV-VV      = DATKORT-D-VECKA                                               
  WS-TIAAVV     = INNEV-AAVV                                                    
  WS-TIAAVV-START = INNEV-AAVV                                                  
  WS-TIAAVV-SLUT  = INNEV-AAVV                                                  
  WS-ANTAL-VECKOR = 1                                                           
  CALL W009VADD USING (WS-TIAAVV-START +                                        
                       WS-ANTAL-VECKOR)                                         
*    *** HÄMTA ANTAL VECKOR I NÄSTA REDOVISNINGSPERIOD                          
  DAT-I-TIDATUM = WS-TIAAVV-START                                               
  DAT-KDDATFORM = 'AAVV'                                                        
  CALL WDATKONV USING (DAT-KDDATFORM,  +                                        
                       DAT-I-TIDATUM,  +                                        
                       DAT-O-TIDATUM,  +                                        
                       DAT-KDSVAR)                                              
  IF DAT-KDSVAR = ' '                                                           
      WS-ANTAL-VECKOR = DAT-KVVIPER                                             
  ELSE                                                                          
      DISPLAY 'FEL FRÅN DATKONV'                                                
      STOP EXECUTE                                                              
  END-IF                                                                        
  CALL W009VADD USING (WS-TIAAVV-SLUT  +                                        
                       WS-ANTAL-VECKOR)                                         
  END-PROC                                                                      
                                                                                
 NEWPAGE                                                                        
%WY2000Q3                                                                       
%WWPRODSL 'LB-' PROC ''                                                         
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
REPORT RAPPORT01 PRINTER W11186D3 LINESIZE 120 DTLCTL FIRST     +               
       NOADJUST PAGESIZE 41 TITLESKIP 3 NOSPREAD      +                         
       SUMCTL ALL                                                               
SEQUENCE LB-IDFKNGRP LB-IDARTNR                                                 
                                                                                
TITLE 1  COL 12  'VOLVO CAR PARTS      '                        +               
         COL 40  'LISTING PRODUCT GROUP 11, 15               '                  
                                                                                
TITLE 2  COL 40  ' PUBL WEEK ' WS-TIAAVV-START ' - ' WS-TIAAVV-SLUT             
                                                                                
HEADING WS-IDFKNGRP    ('FUNC.' 'GROUP')                                        
HEADING WS-IDARTNR     ('PART NO')                                              
HEADING LB-BEART-ENG   ('DESCRIPTION')                                          
HEADING LB-KDBPSR      ('BPSR')                                                 
HEADING WS-TIFINLV1    ('PUBL' 'WEEK')                                          
HEADING NOTERING       ('NOTES')                                                
HEADING WS-IDBERED     ('PLANNER')                                              
                                                                                
LINE 01  WS-IDFKNGRP WS-IDARTNR LB-BEART-ENG LB-KDBPSR          +               
         WS-TIFINLV1 NOTERING WS-IDBERED                                        
LINE 02  W-BLANK NOTERING-7                                                     
